WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.336
Open Infographic to choose a visual format.

00:00:01.336 --> 00:00:04.379
Set the visual style, detail and comparison to show.

00:00:04.379 --> 00:00:07.870
Open and inspect the infographic generated from the chapter.

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:11.125
Inspect the generated comparison and verify each label against the chapter.

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:13.580
Open the artifact menu to find its Download command.
